# Aliyun captcha HMAC secret — REQUIRED by the bridge's captcha mint path.
# The captcha-open endpoints ignore the AccessKey ID but validate this HMAC.
# Copy the value ("KEY_SECRET" constant) from the upstream repo's
# internal/zbridge/config.go, then save this file as GLM-Free-API/aliyun.env
# (both spawn paths load it: scripts/start_zai_api.sh via 'set -a',
# the panel daemon manager via explicit env parsing).
ALIYUN_CAPTCHA_SECRET=<captcha-signing-constant>
